Sentinel Platform — GitOps & Integration Layer
================================================

Original design and architecture by Kaushikkumaran
GitHub: https://github.com/CodeBuildder/sentinel-platform
First committed: June 2026

This repo defines the shared contract the Sentinel platform is built on:
- The cross-agent event schema (event_type, source_agent, severity, component,
  causality, timestamp, payload)
- The Helm umbrella chart and deployment harness wiring Argus, Phoenix, and Sentinel
- Shared k3s manifests for the platform's event bus and chaos-injection layer

Commit history on GitHub serves as timestamped proof of authorship.

